==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*30 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Commander Ostromeda]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**4 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Devil Wives will make stacking units difficult with their Death Surges, so it is recommended that you stall in the beginning to build up money. Long ranged attackers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] should be your main source of damage during the boss phase. For said boss, [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] will be your primary Meatshield, and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] can crowd control Commander Ostromeda. Like R. Ost, multiple small meatshields should be used alongside Catellite.

